        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Average technology\n\n# Included processes\nThe inventory includes the energy consumption of a goods train in Switzerland using electro energy only (no shunting processes are accounted for). In addition also the production and maintenance of vehicles as well as the construction and maintenance of the rail way tracks are accounted for.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
